        "meaning": "A_U=\\sum_{r,t}(R_{rt}^{use}+S_{rt})\\Delta t,\\ W_U=\\sum_{r,t}R_{rt}^{av}\\Delta t;\\quad W_U>0\\Rightarrow U_{RE}=A_U/W_U\\ge\\varepsilon_U",
        "hard": true
